# Allowlist: track only what is listed below. Source copies, transcripts and
# extractions stay local (private paths; see RiVaL-export-guide.md).
*
!.gitignore
!CHANGELOG.md
!extract-html-visible.py
!rival-design/
!rival-design/project/
!rival-design/project/*.dc.html
!rival-design/project/canvas.json
!rival-design/docs/
!rival-design/docs/*.md
!export-full-transcript.py
!README.md
!docs/
!docs/**

# --- Public repo rules (from origin/main), kept below so they re-exclude anything above ---
# Secrets and credentials
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
*credentials*.json
*token*.json
*auth*.json

# Local runtime and personal agent state
Cindy/
CindyGlobal/
**/Application Support/Cindy/
**/Application Support/CindyGlobal/
**/memories/
**/codex-home/
**/claude-code/
**/pi-agent-home/
**/.runtime-skills/
**/nightly-learning.json
*.db
*.db-*
*.sqlite
*.sqlite-*
*.bak
*.bak.*

# Python / Node / editors
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/
node_modules/
dist/
build/
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/

# Local exports and archives: review explicitly before committing
*.zip
*.tar
*.tar.gz
*.7z
*.log

# --- Worktree "what was / what is to be": tracked reference, not the referenced files ---
!WAS-AND-TO-BE.md
!outside-reference.py
!reference/
!reference/outside-manifest-*.json
!coverart-arcana/
!coverart-arcana/*.py
!coverart-arcana/*.html
!coverart-arcana/*.png
